{"about_the_game":"Legend of Kendor is a <strong>Fantasy Free-Roaming Action Roguelike\u00a0game</strong>.<br><br>You can explore different biomes and gather powerful items and weapons as one of the four heroes in Kendor. The great wizard's spell protects the fallen heroes until all the lost come back. Because the spell is imbalanced, every time heroes rise, everything will be changed. You have 30 minutes to save your loved ones. Level up, enchant your weapon, and find powerful items to be strong. Can they save all their loved ones with your help?<br><br>Current Game Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No Meta Progression &amp; No Loading Screen <br></li><li>Permanent Death<br></li><li>100+ items and weapons<br></li><li>10+ Adorable puppies, cats, and a dragon you can pet<br></li><li>20+ Killable NPC with own consequences <br></li><li>No certain path you have to take. Play however you like!<br></li><li>Rebindable keyboard and controller setting<br></li><li>Controller Support  <br></li><li>Smooth Pixel Perfect graphic with 60 FPS<br></li><li>Sound Effect by Niilo Takalainen<br></li><li>Addictive game music written by ModalModule </li></ul><br><strong>Planned Features during Early Access</strong><br><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Localization - coming soon!<br></li><li>Local CO-OP up to 2 Players with Friendly Fire! <br></li><li>Hidden Playable Character<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Steam Leaderboard <br></li><li>More Items, NPCs, Monsters and Weapons<br></li><li>More hidden playable characters<br></li></ul></i><br><br><strong>Legend of Kendor is Heavily inspired<br>by Nuclear Throne, Risk of Rain, The Binding of Isaac, Enter the Gungeon, NetHack and other same genre games.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1274230?t=1673761058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1274230?t=1673761058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i